step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the simplest robust baseline: mean of all models in the full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse_error to test if weighting improves over simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming extreme errors improves over mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if it improves over trimmed mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on a smaller, high‑performance pool (pool1) to see if focusing on the top performers improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using the pooled_meta_model weighting (w1) to see if a meta‑model based weighting beats the inverse‑error weighting on pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean of the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing model count improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse_error to see if it beats the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool2 to see if adding more diverse models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test whether the single best model THETA alone outperforms the current weighted pool1 combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the more stable pool1 to see if it improves over the weighted mean that currently leads.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a more sophisticated robust combination—dba on the stable pool1—to see if it can beat the median pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

